From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Kompakt: the settings icon is inked in light mode

The toolbar's settings icon is drawn in white with no tint, so it vanished
on the white header. It takes the clock's ink: black in light, white in dark.
---
diff --git a/res/drawable/ic_settings.xml b/res/drawable/ic_settings.xml
--- a/res/drawable/ic_settings.xml
+++ b/res/drawable/ic_settings.xml
@@ -7,7 +7,8 @@
     android:width="24dp"
     android:height="24dp"
     android:viewportWidth="960"
-    android:viewportHeight="960">
+    android:viewportHeight="960"
+    android:tint="@color/kompakt_alarm_ink">

     <path
         android:fillColor="@android:color/white"
